[b]Changelog:[/b]
[list]
[*] Added two new weapons;
[*] Added a new special event;
[*] Fixed game freezing when enemy loses a weapon;
[*] Fixed game freezing when enemies call for reinforcements;
[*] Fixed Mother of Shadows attack stopping combat;
[*] Fixed several graphical bugs;
[*] Fixed several small errors and bugs;
